WEBVTT

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:05.340
My name is Hoshizora Miyuki.

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:11.580
I believe in the power of happiness and smiles, and that together they'll lead you to a dazzling future!

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:15.590
So I'm always trying to find ultra happiness, day in, day out.

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:19.060
But you know... what exactly is being ultra happy?

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:21.900
I can't wait to go shopping-kuru!

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:23.540
Yeah, me too!

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:24.880
Oh, there they are!

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:25.900
Miyuki!

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:28.240
Sorry I'm late, guys!

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:31.660
Owchie...

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:34.110
Are you okay, dear?

00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:35.060
Yeah...

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:37.050
Here, Onee-chan!

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:38.900
You dropped your plushie.

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:40.850
Oh, thank you!

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:49.800
What's wrong?

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:51.700
Oh, it's nothing!

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:52.760
Really?

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:54.630
Bye bye, Onee-chan!

00:00:55.160 --> 00:00:56.330
Bye bye!

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:58.020
You two okay after that?

00:00:58.020 --> 00:00:59.700
I hurt my head-kuru!

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:01.000
Sorry!

00:01:01.010 --> 00:01:03.000
You <i>did</i> fall pretty hard...

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.660
<i>That mirror...</i>

00:01:07.220 --> 00:01:08.820
<i>It looked a bit like mine...</i>

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:13.990
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:15.860
Smile Precure!

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:16.730
Let's go!

00:01:16.730 --> 00:01:18.260
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:19.390
All together!

00:01:19.630 --> 00:01:21.000
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:23.200
Jump to tomorrow!

00:01:23.370 --> 00:01:25.870
Smile Precure!

00:01:27.740 --> 00:01:30.710
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:01:30.970 --> 00:01:36.180
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:41.350
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:47.280
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:01:47.650 --> 00:01:52.160
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:01:51.610 --> 00:01:52.160
So bright!

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:57.410
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:03.500
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:04.340
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:02:04.840 --> 00:02:05.500
Let's go!

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:08.090
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:02:08.210 --> 00:02:11.130
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:02:11.470 --> 00:02:15.930
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:16.510
Girls! Let's go!

00:02:16.510 --> 00:02:18.060
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:18.060 --> 00:02:19.270
Everybody!

00:02:19.390 --> 00:02:20.770
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:20.770 --> 00:02:23.520
Fly to the future!

00:02:23.850 --> 00:02:27.020
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:29.130
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:31.500
Smile Precure!

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:37.050
Damn it all!

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:41.300
Damn it all to hell!

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:44.690
There's no way I'm going back to the base like <i>this!</i>

00:02:46.150 --> 00:02:48.770
No... I'm a lone wolf, through and through!

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:51.170
I've gotta be as free as the wind!

00:02:51.470 --> 00:02:53.290
<i>Wolfrun-san...</i>

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:56.700
<i>Are you that eager to return to how you were in the past?</i>

00:02:59.270 --> 00:03:02.680
This is my last nose... my last chance!

00:03:03.010 --> 00:03:05.770
Then I know just who my target's gotta be...

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:11.990
Cure Happy!

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:23.630
You're still thinking about that kid's mirror?

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:24.400
Yeah...

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:27.870
When I was a kid, one of my treasures was a mirror just like that.

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:29.340
So... what about it?

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:30.150
Well...

00:03:30.150 --> 00:03:35.850
See, it's thanks to my mirror that I realized the importance of smiling.

00:03:37.010 --> 00:03:41.730
I guess it all comes back to the first friend I ever made...

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:51.190
When I was really little, we had to go live with my grandma for a while because of dad's work.

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:55.250
The one we visited during summer vacation, I presume?

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:55.900
Right.

00:03:56.470 --> 00:04:01.900
I was really shy back then, and always afraid of having to talk to new people.

00:04:02.370 --> 00:04:05.870
So I always just sat around the house reading fairytales all day.

00:04:06.590 --> 00:04:07.780
But then, one day...

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:12.890
My grandma was worried about me, and gave me this mirror.

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:18.420
You know what they say, Miyuki. All good things come to those who smile.

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:22.260
If you give the world a smile, all sorts of fun awaits you!

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:28.990
Huh. Wasn't expectin' that.

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:33.540
I kinda assumed you were always this peppy, Miyuki-chan.

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:37.270
Well, see... I used to play with that mirror all the time.

00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:45.610
And that's what gave me the courage to take that first step!

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:55.820
The mirror was like my lucky charm that gave me the strength to venture outside...

00:04:58.060 --> 00:04:59.110
Now what?

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:00.590
I wanna serve you now!

00:05:00.590 --> 00:05:00.990
Okay!

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:03.230
Good afternoon!

00:05:03.230 --> 00:05:04.720
Welcome!

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:06.130
How can I serve you today?

00:05:06.130 --> 00:05:08.270
I'll have a kids meal, please!

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:10.410
Would you like fries with that?

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:11.610
Yes, please!

00:05:12.280 --> 00:05:13.080
Here you go!

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:15.140
Thank you very much!

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:22.170
Who's that?

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:23.220
I've never seen her before...

00:05:23.690 --> 00:05:25.650
Hey, what's your name?

00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:28.030
M-My name...?

00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:30.480
Oooh, that's a pretty mirror!

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:31.830
It is!

00:05:32.090 --> 00:05:33.430
Lemme see!

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:36.650
Huh?!

00:05:39.930 --> 00:05:44.010
My venture outside didn't make me new friends after all...

00:05:47.510 --> 00:05:50.410
Mirror, mirror, on the wall...

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:52.850
Where...

00:05:53.980 --> 00:05:56.580
is someone who'll be my friend...?

00:06:41.550 --> 00:06:44.760
What was her name, this friend of yours?

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:50.770
I can't remember, actually... I'm not sure I even asked her...

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:53.180
Guess ya were as dense back then as ya are now, huh?

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:54.930
So, what happened next?

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:56.240
Well...

00:06:56.240 --> 00:07:01.220
Whenever I went to play under that big tree, she'd always be there to play with me...

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:14.850
I used to spend all day just chatting with her, and playing silly games together...

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:19.370
We had so much fun, and those times meant the world to me...

00:07:22.600 --> 00:07:29.280
So I thought I'd draw all the stuff we were doing together, and make my own fairytale diary out of it...

00:07:32.510 --> 00:07:38.010
I was heading towards the tree with the book, hoping to show it to her, and that's when it happened...

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:42.420
Oh, it's that girl from before!

00:07:44.210 --> 00:07:46.810
I was about to run away again, when...

00:07:49.290 --> 00:07:50.550
Smile!

00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:58.440
I could've sworn I heard this voice telling me to smile...

00:08:15.150 --> 00:08:16.190
H-H-He...

00:08:16.690 --> 00:08:18.890
Hello!

00:08:28.380 --> 00:08:29.650
Hello!

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:30.970
Hello!

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:33.850
What's your name?

00:08:33.850 --> 00:08:35.150
Hoshizora Miyuki...

00:08:35.150 --> 00:08:37.180
Miyuki-chan? That's a cute name!

00:08:37.180 --> 00:08:38.900
What's that you've got?

00:08:38.900 --> 00:08:41.270
It's a fairytale... I drew...

00:08:41.270 --> 00:08:43.650
What?! You've gotta let us see!

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:50.470
How cute!

00:08:53.030 --> 00:08:55.060
Miyuki-chan, you're really good at this!

00:08:55.060 --> 00:08:56.970
Yeah, you are!

00:08:56.970 --> 00:08:58.550
How'd you get so good?!

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:02.240
Do you draw a lot?!

00:09:02.240 --> 00:09:03.190
Wow!

00:09:03.940 --> 00:09:05.240
So cute!

00:09:05.240 --> 00:09:07.190
It's really cute!

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:08.910
Is this you, Miyuki-chan?

00:09:08.910 --> 00:09:09.810
It's the spitting image!

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:11.250
You're right!

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:22.190
Sure enough, when I was brave enough to take that first step...

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:25.090
a bright, shining future opened up to me.

00:09:25.270 --> 00:09:30.660
That made me realize... that I'd never be happy if I sat around moping all day.

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:34.670
But if I smiled, happiness would be sure to find me.

00:09:35.540 --> 00:09:39.510
It's taken a long time, but I'm able to introduce myself to people now.

00:09:40.210 --> 00:09:42.710
I've learned how to make friends!

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:46.080
So, what happened to that very first friend you made?

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:52.050
That's the weird thing. I never saw her again after that...

00:09:52.060 --> 00:09:55.190
I never got to show her my fairytale.

00:09:55.190 --> 00:10:00.130
And the weirdest part of all is, everyone I asked said they'd never seen her before.

00:10:00.130 --> 00:10:00.830
What?!

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:02.330
That <i>is</i> weird, ain't it?

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:05.030
But looking back on it...

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:10.070
I kinda think she might have been the fairy of my grandma's mirror.

00:10:11.190 --> 00:10:13.850
But I don't live in a mirror-kuru!

00:10:13.850 --> 00:10:15.480
She's not talking about you, Candy.

00:10:16.870 --> 00:10:19.490
It is a lovely story, nonetheless.

00:10:19.490 --> 00:10:20.470
Thanks.

00:10:21.110 --> 00:10:22.250
It's thanks to her...

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:26.750
that I've been able to spend every day looking for happiness.

00:10:28.590 --> 00:10:31.110
Yeah, I remember you sayin' when you first came here...

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:31.950
Right.

00:10:33.060 --> 00:10:35.300
And the search has never ended.

00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:39.600
The search for my true ultra happiness!

00:10:40.650 --> 00:10:43.110
Your true ultra happiness...?

00:10:43.750 --> 00:10:44.530
Yeah!

00:10:47.140 --> 00:10:49.180
This goddamn stinks.

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:52.180
All this happiness in the air, that's what it is!

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:57.520
I'll wipe every last trace of it out... alongside <i>you,</i> Cure Happy!

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:02.950
Happy!

00:11:08.780 --> 00:11:09.720
Happy!

00:11:12.220 --> 00:11:13.980
What do you mean by "your true ultra happiness"?

00:11:14.450 --> 00:11:17.680
Well, I guess figuring that out's the hard part, huh?

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:20.640
Yeah, but ya know what's bafflin' me?

00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:23.760
It's hard to imagine you being so... quiet, Miyuki-chan.

00:11:26.360 --> 00:11:27.290
Akane-chan!

00:11:28.090 --> 00:11:29.290
Yayoi-chan!

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:30.260
Nao-chan!

00:11:30.260 --> 00:11:31.480
Reika-chan!

00:11:31.480 --> 00:11:32.400
Candy!

00:11:35.400 --> 00:11:37.540
What's gotten into you?

00:11:39.600 --> 00:11:41.070
Just wanted to say your names!

00:11:41.070 --> 00:11:41.900
Huh?!

00:11:41.900 --> 00:11:43.160
You're so weird, Miyuki-chan.

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:44.980
Miyuki always has been weird-kuru!

00:11:46.320 --> 00:11:47.880
Ya got that right!

00:11:54.320 --> 00:11:56.020
Isn't that the girl from before?

00:12:00.880 --> 00:12:02.400
She looks rather perturbed...

00:12:03.220 --> 00:12:04.230
Miyuki-chan!

00:12:04.230 --> 00:12:06.190
Hey, what's wrong?

00:12:06.190 --> 00:12:07.580
Where's your mommy?

00:12:09.640 --> 00:12:11.420
Oh god, I'm sorry!

00:12:12.700 --> 00:12:15.380
It's gonna be okay! Could you tell us your name?

00:12:16.280 --> 00:12:16.910
Yura...

00:12:16.910 --> 00:12:17.710
Nao-chan...

00:12:18.010 --> 00:12:20.010
I'm used to dealing with lost kids!

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:23.000
A'ight then! We'll just have to go find her mom!

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:23.880
Sounds good!

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:26.420
I am certain we'll be able to locate her!

00:12:27.420 --> 00:12:28.970
Guys...

00:12:29.690 --> 00:12:32.780
Alright, Miyuki-chan, you stay here with Yura-chan and wait for us.

00:12:32.780 --> 00:12:35.460
I'm sure her mother won't have gone far without her.

00:12:35.460 --> 00:12:37.930
Alright! We'll wait here for you.

00:12:42.060 --> 00:12:44.870
Yura-chan, it won't be long now, okay?

00:12:47.960 --> 00:12:51.380
Oh, Yura-chan! Where did you get that mirror?

00:12:52.020 --> 00:12:53.870
It's really pretty!

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:57.040
My mommy gave it to me...

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:58.320
Oh, I see!

00:12:58.320 --> 00:13:04.020
I'm a real crybaby, so my mommy put a magic charm on it to stop me crying so much...

00:13:04.020 --> 00:13:06.370
Wow! What a nice mom she is.

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:06.920
Yeah...

00:13:07.360 --> 00:13:08.920
You love your mom, don't you, Yura-chan?

00:13:08.920 --> 00:13:10.070
I love her a lot!

00:13:10.070 --> 00:13:11.000
That's good!

00:13:12.920 --> 00:13:17.200
Being surrounded by the kindness of others really does warm your heart...

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:22.620
And that, in turn, makes you feel really happy...

00:13:22.620 --> 00:13:25.910
Maybe that's what my true ultra happiness is!

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:35.420
Yura-chan!

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:37.600
I've got you now, Cure Happy!

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:41.590
You've been driving me crazy since the day we first met!

00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:44.000
Hurry and transform!

00:13:44.330 --> 00:13:47.700
Once I destroy you, I can start from a clean slate!

00:13:48.100 --> 00:13:50.600
What's gotten into him...? He's different from usual!

00:13:55.460 --> 00:13:56.780
Ready?

00:13:57.310 --> 00:14:00.020
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:00.960
Go!

00:14:02.090 --> 00:14:03.210
Go, go!

00:14:03.840 --> 00:14:05.360
Let's Go: Happy!

00:14:26.620 --> 00:14:29.440
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:32.800
Cure Happy!

00:14:34.980 --> 00:14:36.720
This ends, right here, right now!

00:14:36.720 --> 00:14:40.050
Come forth, Hyper Akanbe!

00:14:44.720 --> 00:14:47.190
Hyper Akanbe!

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:47.830
Hyper!

00:14:56.680 --> 00:14:58.000
Eat this!

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:01.470
What's the matter, Cure Happy?!

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:17.170
Every time I look at you, it pisses me off!

00:15:17.170 --> 00:15:19.060
It makes me sick to my frickin' stomach!

00:15:19.990 --> 00:15:23.700
Why do you act like this...?
What could fill you with such hatred...?

00:15:25.460 --> 00:15:28.370
It's you! You, blathering on about friends and smiles!

00:15:28.370 --> 00:15:31.700
It's the sickest damn joke I've ever heard in my life!

00:15:31.960 --> 00:15:35.410
You pathetic little brats can't do anything by yourselves!

00:15:35.670 --> 00:15:39.880
And yet you prance around smiling like you're better than anyone else! It gets under my fur!

00:15:40.610 --> 00:15:43.050
My friends... matter...

00:15:43.050 --> 00:15:44.320
What'd you say?!

00:15:44.320 --> 00:15:48.480
Every time I'm touched by my friends' kindness, it fills me with joy...

00:15:52.280 --> 00:15:54.430
It makes me feel so happy...

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:58.560
Oh, shut up already! This is exactly what I'm so pissed off about!

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:01.770
I love my friends so much...

00:16:02.200 --> 00:16:08.040
It's because of their kindness... their desire to protect others, that they all became Precure...

00:16:09.530 --> 00:16:16.420
So you might think it's stupid, but to us it's the most important thing in the world!

00:16:18.320 --> 00:16:20.050
Not this gibberish again!

00:16:35.330 --> 00:16:36.400
You little runt...

00:16:36.620 --> 00:16:40.510
It's because of the kindness that they showed to me...

00:16:41.170 --> 00:16:45.780
that even a shy coward like me was able to take that first step!

00:16:46.600 --> 00:16:50.750
And it's the same for them! When they thought something was impossible to do alone...

00:16:50.750 --> 00:16:55.090
the kindness and support of others meant they were able to see it through, together!

00:16:55.850 --> 00:17:04.330
It's not just friends, either... it's our parents, our families, our classmates, our teachers!

00:17:05.020 --> 00:17:08.300
And of course... Candy.... she means the world to us.

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:15.140
The kindness they've all showed to me has given me the strength I needed to persevere!

00:17:15.140 --> 00:17:21.780
They've given me the courage to press on forward...! Their warmth has touched my very heart!

00:17:23.420 --> 00:17:27.220
They've given me the ultra happiness I was looking for!

00:17:27.220 --> 00:17:33.760
Shut your damn face! I don't wanna hear it, I don't wanna hear any of your crap! I'm gonna crush you flat!

00:17:35.430 --> 00:17:42.400
Over my dead body! I won't let their kindness be stamped out by the likes of you!

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:49.540
I swear, on my life... that I will protect them, no matter what it takes!

00:17:53.810 --> 00:17:55.010
The heck—?!

00:18:00.950 --> 00:18:04.920
That light... it's just like what happened to Cure Sunny before!

00:18:04.920 --> 00:18:06.560
You little runt...!

00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:09.790
Hyper Aka—?!

00:18:19.220 --> 00:18:24.580
Damn it... what's with you?! The heck is your damn problem?!

00:18:25.190 --> 00:18:30.040
You're just a weak little runt... but you keep on fighting us back, with that resolute look in your eyes!

00:18:31.480 --> 00:18:37.360
Don't look at me... Don't look at me <i>like that!</i>

00:18:38.460 --> 00:18:41.220
To hell with you!

00:18:42.900 --> 00:18:44.200
Precure...

00:18:46.900 --> 00:18:49.960
Happy Shower...

00:18:54.260 --> 00:18:57.080
Shining!

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:18.400
Now, you tell <i>me...</i> Why do you hate us so much...?

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:25.940
I can't lose! I can't afford to lose, not anymore!

00:19:32.980 --> 00:19:33.540
Guys!

00:19:33.540 --> 00:19:35.040
Sorry we're late!

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:36.280
Are you okay?

00:19:38.260 --> 00:19:42.900
Why...?! Why do you do this to me, you damned brats?!

00:19:43.560 --> 00:19:45.080
Come on, let's finish this!

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:46.020
Right!

00:19:47.960 --> 00:19:50.080
Reveal your secrets, Royal Clock!

00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:53.880
Combine our powers together-kuru!

00:19:58.360 --> 00:20:01.360
May the light of hope shine!

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:05.600
Let it soar to a radiant future!

00:20:06.420 --> 00:20:08.440
Precure...

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:11.980
Royal Rainbow...

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:14.440
Burst!

00:20:17.490 --> 00:20:20.360
Damn you all!

00:20:23.160 --> 00:20:27.200
Shine, Happy Smiles!

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:35.670
We just need one more Décor to revive the Royal Queen-kuru!

00:20:39.180 --> 00:20:41.650
Thanks for everything, Onee-chan!

00:20:41.650 --> 00:20:43.380
Bye bye!

00:20:46.860 --> 00:20:47.900
It's snowing!

00:20:48.820 --> 00:20:50.090
How pretty-kuru...

00:20:53.640 --> 00:20:57.820
You know, I found my ultra happiness, thanks to you guys!

00:20:54.620 --> 00:21:00.330
Let's carry all our hopes and dreams towards the future

00:20:59.330 --> 00:21:03.770
It boils down to this: the kindness we all show to each other.

00:21:00.330 --> 00:21:06.030
And together, we'll take the first step down a new road

00:21:04.340 --> 00:21:10.240
When I feel ultra happy, it's always because someone's kindness has touched my heart...

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:10.360
If we believe in ourselves, I know we'll make our dream come true

00:21:10.500 --> 00:21:17.290
To bring the greatest of smiles to all of you!

00:21:10.720 --> 00:21:18.580
So that's why I want to share all the happiness you've given to me with the whole wide world!

00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:21.660
That's such a lovely thought...

00:21:21.660 --> 00:21:24.150
The kindness we show to each other...

00:21:24.150 --> 00:21:25.410
How marvelous.

00:21:25.410 --> 00:21:26.930
It's love, ain't it? Love!

00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:31.920
So let's head out into this world full of hopes and dreams

00:21:31.920 --> 00:21:36.710
We can soar and open up the gates in our way

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:40.290
I guess I see now how much you all mean to me

00:21:40.620 --> 00:21:45.430
So thanks for everything, I hope we'll be friends forever!

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:47.200
My name is Hoshizora Miyuki.

00:21:48.520 --> 00:21:55.660
I believe in the power of mutual happiness and smiles, and that together, we'll find ourselves a dazzling future!

00:21:57.220 --> 00:22:00.720
Let's find our ultra happy smiles!

00:23:38.860 --> 00:23:40.690
I-It can't be!

00:23:40.710 --> 00:23:42.050
It's Pierrot's egg!

00:23:42.050 --> 00:23:43.400
And it's heading for Earth!

00:23:43.400 --> 00:23:46.390
If we don't do something, the whole world will face a Bad End-kuru!

00:23:46.400 --> 00:23:48.430
We have to stop them at all costs!

00:23:48.430 --> 00:23:50.350
We cannot afford to lose this battle!

00:23:50.350 --> 00:23:51.710
Come on, everyone!

00:23:52.140 --> 00:23:54.370
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:23:54.370 --> 00:23:56.840
You have to fight, Precure!

00:23:57.280 --> 00:23:58.740
Smile Precure:

00:24:01.780 --> 00:24:03.920
Find your ultra happy smiles!
